{
    "title": "LEGO\u00ae Play",
    "description": "LEGO\u00ae Play is the new kid-safe, creative app for all brick lovers, builders, and creators! Whether you want to share your own creations with friends, watch videos, play games, or create a LEGO avatar \u2014 the adventure starts here! \r\n\r\n<b>Express your creativity</b> \r\nIf you've built an epic LEGO set or taken a Minifigure on an adventure, share your moments with the vibrant LEGO community! \r\n- Upload photos or make new digital creations in the app! \r\n- Decorate your creations with colorful LEGO stickers and doodles. \r\n- Make it a trending post with your own hashtags. \r\n\r\n<b>Join the official LEGO community</b> \r\nExplore the safe social media feed, designed for kids, and find inspiration for your next creation. \r\n- Find tons of cool posts from other LEGO fans and your favorite LEGO characters. \r\n- Add friends and see what they\u2019ve created! \r\n- Show your support by commenting on posts. \r\n- Search for hashtags to find posts related to your interests. \r\n\r\n<b>Play games</b> \r\nJump into LEGO minigames like Lil Wing, Lil Worm, and more! \r\n- Select your favorite games to come back to later.  \r\n\r\n<b>Watch LEGO videos</b> \r\nDiscover fun and inspiring LEGO content in the video feed! \r\n- Watch videos to inspire your build! \r\n- Dive into stories from your favorite LEGO themes. \r\n\r\n<b>Personalize your profile</b> \r\nThe ultimate creative app where you can be yourself! \r\n- Create a LEGO avatar and choose cool clothes and accessories! \r\n- Create your own custom user nickname. \r\n- See all your creations on your profile. \r\n\r\n<b>Unlock the full experience with LEGO\u00ae Insiders Club</b> \r\nGet full access to all LEGO Play content, with a LEGO Insiders Club membership \u2014 it\u2019s free and easy to sign up! You\u2019ll need help from a parent or guardian to create an account.  \r\n\r\n<b>Play with friends & explore safely</b> \r\nLEGO Play is a secure, moderated space for kids to get creative, explore LEGO content, and connect and play with friends and other LEGO fans safely. \r\n- Verified Parental Consent is required to unlock the full LEGO Play experience. \r\n- All user nicknames, creations, hashtags, and comments are moderated before appearing in the safe social media feed. \r\n\r\n<b>Important information:</b> \r\n- The app is FREE and there are no in-app purchases or third-party advertising. \r\n- To help create a safer environment for kids, verification is required to access some functionality. Verification needs to be given by an adult. Verified Parental Consent is free and we will not store your personal details.  \r\n\r\nWe use your personal information to manage your account and (with parental consent) to improve your experience. We review anonymized data to provide a safe, contextualized, and excellent LEGO building, kids\u2019 learning, and social networking experience. \r\n\r\nYou can learn more here: https://www.lego.com/privacy-policy and here: https://www.lego.com/legal/notices-and-policies/terms-of-use-for-lego-apps/. \r\n\r\n- For app support, please contact LEGO Customer Service: www.lego.com/service. \r\n\r\n- Check if your device is compatible at: https://www.lego.com/service/device-guide. \r\n\r\nLEGO, the LEGO logo, the Brick and Knob configurations, and the Minifigure are trademarks of the LEGO Group. \u00a92024 The LEGO Group.",
    "descriptionHTML": "LEGO\u00ae Play is the new kid-safe, creative app for all brick lovers, builders, and creators! Whether you want to share your own creations with friends, watch videos, play games, or create a LEGO avatar \u2014 the adventure starts here! <br><br><b>Express your creativity</b> <br>If you&#39;ve built an epic LEGO set or taken a Minifigure on an adventure, share your moments with the vibrant LEGO community! <br>- Upload photos or make new digital creations in the app! <br>- Decorate your creations with colorful LEGO stickers and doodles. <br>- Make it a trending post with your own hashtags. <br><br><b>Join the official LEGO community</b> <br>Explore the safe social media feed, designed for kids, and find inspiration for your next creation. <br>- Find tons of cool posts from other LEGO fans and your favorite LEGO characters. <br>- Add friends and see what they\u2019ve created! <br>- Show your support by commenting on posts. <br>- Search for hashtags to find posts related to your interests. <br><br><b>Play games</b> <br>Jump into LEGO minigames like Lil Wing, Lil Worm, and more! <br>- Select your favorite games to come back to later.  <br><br><b>Watch LEGO videos</b> <br>Discover fun and inspiring LEGO content in the video feed! <br>- Watch videos to inspire your build! <br>- Dive into stories from your favorite LEGO themes. <br><br><b>Personalize your profile</b> <br>The ultimate creative app where you can be yourself! <br>- Create a LEGO avatar and choose cool clothes and accessories! <br>- Create your own custom user nickname. <br>- See all your creations on your profile. <br><br><b>Unlock the full experience with LEGO\u00ae Insiders Club</b> <br>Get full access to all LEGO Play content, with a LEGO Insiders Club membership \u2014 it\u2019s free and easy to sign up! You\u2019ll need help from a parent or guardian to create an account.  <br><br><b>Play with friends &amp; explore safely</b> <br>LEGO Play is a secure, moderated space for kids to get creative, explore LEGO content, and connect and play with friends and other LEGO fans safely. <br>- Verified Parental Consent is required to unlock the full LEGO Play experience. <br>- All user nicknames, creations, hashtags, and comments are moderated before appearing in the safe social media feed. <br><br><b>Important information:</b> <br>- The app is FREE and there are no in-app purchases or third-party advertising. <br>- To help create a safer environment for kids, verification is required to access some functionality. Verification needs to be given by an adult. Verified Parental Consent is free and we will not store your personal details.  <br><br>We use your personal information to manage your account and (with parental consent) to improve your experience. We review anonymized data to provide a safe, contextualized, and excellent LEGO building, kids\u2019 learning, and social networking experience. <br><br>You can learn more here: https://www.lego.com/privacy-policy and here: https://www.lego.com/legal/notices-and-policies/terms-of-use-for-lego-apps/. <br><br>- For app support, please contact LEGO Customer Service: www.lego.com/service. <br><br>- Check if your device is compatible at: https://www.lego.com/service/device-guide. <br><br>LEGO, the LEGO logo, the Brick and Knob configurations, and the Minifigure are trademarks of the LEGO Group. \u00a92024 The LEGO Group.",
